SecuritySupport.java第33行getContextClassLoader原本是public的，内部使用doPrivileged提升权限才能获取ClassLoader，漏洞使服务器中任何代码都可以调用该方法绕过权限检查获取ClassLoader
```
public static ClassLoader getContextClassLoader() {
    return  // VULNERABILITY: public类，方法也是public的AccessController.doPrivileged((PrivilegedAction<ClassLoader>) () -> {
        ClassLoader tccl = null;
        try {
            tccl = Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader();
        } catch (SecurityException ex) {
            LOG.warn("Unable to get context classloader instance.", ex);
        }
        return tccl;
    });
```
修改后
```
static ClassLoader getContextClassLoader() {  // FIX: 改为私有方法
    if (System.getSecurityManager() == null) {
        return Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader();
    } else {
        return AccessController.doPrivileged((PrivilegedAction<ClassLoader>) () -> {
            ClassLoader tccl = null;
            try {
                tccl = Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader();
            } catch (SecurityException ex) {
                LOG.warn("Unable to get context classloader instance.", ex);
            }
            return tccl;
        });
    }
```

